// The player: a brown-haired traveller in a long cream tunic, a blue scarf
// tucked at the neck, a pack strap across the chest, a belt, and a
// rucksack on his back, the bedroll on top (the user's figure, cut into
// the rig's parts), drawn on the humanoid rig (parts put together into
// poses; crates/art) in a three-quarter view: the near arm hangs at the
// back of the body, the far arm peeks out in front of it, the near leg in
// front. Facing right; the game mirrors it. The pack is the first layer of
// every pose (tagged `pack`): it comes off while something's worn on the
// back, a cape, a thruster pack (gear/look.rs). (The red-haired one in a
// vest: player_hero17.ron; the old green-tunic adventurer:
// player_classic.ron.)
(
    size: (36, 38),
    feet: (17.5, 38),
    outline: (22, 15, 9),
